.specimens-scratch/
# Scratch artifacts from design threads. Underscore-prefixed at the repo root
# marks "working file, not a deliverable" — the deliverables live in
# docs/brand-package/ and thoughts/plans/.
/_*

# Local macOS visual runs write darwin-suffixed snapshots on first miss;
# the committed visual contract is the Linux set, verified in the pinned
# container. Keep the local artifacts out of the tree so the review gate
# never binds a verdict to a dirty checkout.
tests/visual/**/*-darwin.png
